heads/main/shiziks-solver'))()","features":"quite simple autosolver script tested on xeno & delta (works on both)\n\nhave in mind that script is heavily rage mode based, legit just exist and makes alot of mistakes\n\nfeatures:\n\nrage mode\nstatus - shows current status of the script and acts as a turn on button\n\ntoggle freeze (basically locks your character in place so you can't misstep on a mine)\ntoggle auto guess (automatically tries to predict where the mine could be if there is no solvation)\naction delay (tp cooldown, self explanatory)\nspawn delay (changes the time script would wait after you die in any way)\n\nlegit mode\nstatus - same thing as in rage\n\nauto flag (flags mines in range, kinda buggy)\ncalculate delay (amount of time before the script would calculate again)\nflag range\n\nevent\n\ncollect presents - automatically collects presents if they spawn\n\nmade by @deadshizik","tags":["Minesweeper","Sweeper","Solver","Auto"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/PkFUCUVT","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6942ec9bcfad1856c5cb7f4c","username":"*ikkkkk","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b510855e7f8abfcccc05e90c95ccd93a8c8dc1fa498cf44df7855c25d47475a5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6942ec9bcfad1856c5cb7f4c-1766079124907.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6942ec9bcfad1856c5cb7f4c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b510855e7f8abfcccc05e90c95ccd93a8c8dc1fa498cf44df7855c25d47475a5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6942ec9bcfad1856c5cb7f4c-1766079124907.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T02:45:43.117Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"694c2be4b82f2741fe3761ac","editBy":{"_id":"6942ec9bcfad1856c5cb7f4c","username":"*ikkkk